  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 2,500 gp (lesser), 5,000 gp (normal), 10,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 0 sp</p>\n<p>You can alter talents that inflict damage to inflict nonlethal damage instead. Talents that inflict damage of a particular type (such as fire) inflict nonlethal damage of that same type.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Merciful Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,250 gp (lesser), 2,500 gp (normal), 5,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser tier; held slender rod. Use as part of casting a qualifying sphere effect while holding this apparatus in at least one hand. The effect must be caster level seven or lower. Spend one of 3 daily uses; only one metamagic apparatus may apply per casting. Its feat’s extra spell-point and casting-time costs are waived, but normal effect and other-metamagic costs still apply.</p><p>Convert the selected talent’s damage to nonlethal while retaining its original damage type, such as fire. Do not change unrelated attacks or damage types.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>. Feat Cost applies to taking the feat, not using the physical apparatus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
